bel={"Breadcrumb"} data-anim={"fade"} data-anim-duration={"800"}><ol className={"breadcrumb custom-crumb"}><li className={"breadcrumb-item"}><a href={"#page=demo-financial-planner-1"}>{"Home"}</a></li><li className={"breadcrumb-item"}><a href={"#page=demo-financial-planner-1-insights"}>{"Insights"}</a></li><li className={"breadcrumb-item"} aria-current={"page"}>{"Roth Conversions"}</li></ol></nav><div className={"mt-[clamp(1.75rem,1rem+2vw,3rem)] grid items-end gap-x-10 gap-y-8 lg:grid-cols-12"}><div className={"lg:col-span-8"}><p className={"eyebrow m-0 text-white"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Tax · 7 min read"}</p><h1 id={"fp1-page-title"} className={"mt-5 mb-0 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(2.5rem,1.4rem+3.8vw,5rem)] leading-[1.02] text-balance text-white"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"80"}>{"Roth conversions in a low-income year: "}<span className={"font-light"}>{"who should consider one"}</span></h1><p className={"mt-6 mb-0 max-w-[34rem] text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-white"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"160"}>{"A sabbatical, a gap between jobs or the first years after you stop working can be the cheapest time you'll ever have to move money into a Roth."}</p></div><div className={"lg:col-span-4 lg:justify-self-end"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"240"}><p className={"custom-glass m-0 max-w-none lg:w-max"}><b>{"Theo Faulkner, EA"}</b><span>{"Tax Planning Lead"}</span></p></div></div></div></div></section><section id={"fp1-article"} className={"pt-[clamp(2.5rem,2rem+2vw,4rem)] pb-(--custom-section)"} aria-label={"The article"}><div className={"container"}><img className={"aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-(--radius-xl) object-cover sm:aspect-[21/9]"} style={{"objectPosition": "55% 40%"}} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1800x1200.svg"} alt={"A woman reading through her tax letters at the dining table with a cup of tea"} width={"1800"} height={"1200"} fetchPriority={"high"} decoding={"async"} data-anim={"fade-up"} /><div className={"mt-[clamp(3rem,2rem+3vw,5rem)] grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,46rem)] lg:justify-center lg:gap-[clamp(3rem,1rem+5vw,7rem)]"}><aside className={"grid content-start gap-8 lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start"} aria-label={"About this article"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><div className={"flex items-center gap-3.5"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1000x1333.svg"} alt={""} width={"1000"} height={"1333"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} className={"size-14 rounded-full object-cover object-[50%_25%]"} /><p className={"m-0 text-base leading-snug"}><b className={"block font-semibold"}>{"Theo Faulkner, EA"}</b><span className={"text-soft"}>{"Tax Planning Lead"}</span></p></div><p className={"m-0 border-t border-(--color-border) pt-5 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-soft"}>{"Reviewed by Maya Abbott, CFP®. General education, not individual tax advice."}</p><nav className={"border-t border-(--color-border) pt-5"} aria-label={"In this article"}><p className={"m-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold"}>{"In this article"}</p><ol className={"custom-toc mt-3 mb-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 text-base"} role={"list"}><li><a href={"#fp1-what"}>{"What a conversion is"}</a></li><li><a href={"#fp1-why"}>{"Why the year matters"}</a></li><li><a href={"#fp1-example"}>{"A worked example"}</a></li><li><a href={"#fp1-who"}>{"Who should consider one"}</a></li><li><a href={"#fp1-wait"}>{"Who should wait"}</a></li><li><a href={"#fp1-decide"}>{"How we decide with you"}</a></li></ol></nav><div className={"custom-ask rounded-(--radius-xl) p-5"}><p className={"m-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold"}>{"Thinking about a conversion?"}</p><a href={"#page=demo-financial-planner-1-contact"} className={"mt-1.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-base font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-4 hover:underline"}>{"Talk it through, free "}<i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div></aside><article className={"article-body article-body--flush custom-prose"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"100"}><p className={"custom-prose-lead"}>{"Every dollar in a pre-tax retirement account will be taxed one day. A Roth conversion lets you choose the day, and some years that day is unusually cheap."}</p><h2 id={"fp1-what"}>{"What a Roth conversion is"}</h2><p>{"You move money from a pre-tax account, such as a traditional IRA or an old 401(k), into a Roth IRA. The amount you move counts as income for the year and is taxed at your normal rates. After that it grows tax-free, and qualified withdrawals in retirement are tax-free too."}</p><p>{"Nothing about the investments has to change. It's the tax wrapper that moves, not the portfolio."}</p><h2 id={"fp1-why"}>{"Why the year matters"}</h2><p>{"A conversion is taxed at your marginal rate in the year you make it. In a normal working year that may be 24% or higher. In a low-income year it can be 12% or less: a sabbatical, a gap between jobs, a year of parental leave, or the first years after you stop working and before Social Security and required withdrawals begin."}</p><blockquote><p>{"The cheapest tax you'll ever pay on retirement money is often in a year that feels like a pause."}</p></blockquote><h2 id={"fp1-example"}>{"A worked example"}</h2><div className={"custom-example custom-tint"}><p className={"m-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary-ink"}>{"Hypothetical"}</p><p>{"A couple, both 41, take a year off to travel. Their income for the year is $38,000 from freelance work. They convert $60,000 from an old 401(k)."}</p><dl className={"custom-example-rows"}><div><dt>{"Federal tax on the conversion this year"}</dt><dd>{"≈ $7,000"}</dd></div><div><dt>{"The same $60,000 in a working year at 24%"}</dt><dd>{"≈ $14,400"}</dd></div><div><dt>{"Difference, paid from savings, not the IRA"}</dt><dd>{"≈ $7,400"}</dd></div></dl><p className={"text-[0.9375rem] text-muted"}>{"Rounded, federal tax only, before any state tax. Your numbers will differ."}</p></div><h2 id={"fp1-who"}>{"Who should consider one"}</h2><ul><li>{"You have a low-income year ahead of you, or one that just ended."}</li><li>{"You hold large pre-tax balances you'll have to draw from later anyway."}</li><li>{"You can pay the tax from cash, not from the money you convert."}</li><li>{"You expect your tax rate in retirement to be the same or higher."}</li><li>{"You'd like to leave tax-free money to your children."}</li></ul><h2 id={"fp1-wait"}>{"Who should probably wait"}</h2><ul><li>{"You may need the converted money within five years; each conversion has its own five-year clock."}</li><li>{"You buy health cover on the marketplace, and the extra income would cost you part of your subsidy."}</li><li>{"You're 63 or older, and the income could raise your Medicare premiums two years later."}</li><li>{"The only way to pay the tax would be from the IRA itself."}</li></ul><h2 id={"fp1-decide"}>{"How we decide with you"}</h2><p>{"Before the end of the year we model the conversion inside your plan, bracket by bracket: how much fills the current bracket, what it does to subsidies and premiums, and how it changes the tax you'll pay later. Then we agree on a number, often smaller than people expect, and repeat it in each low-income year."}</p><p className={"custom-prose-note"}>{"This article is general education, not individual tax, legal or investment advice. Talk to your planner or tax professional before converting."}</p></article></div></div></section><section id={"fp1-insights"} className={"py-(--custom-section)"} aria-labelledby={"fp1-insights-title"}><div className={"container"}><div className={"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8"}><div><p className={"eyebrow m-0 text-primary-ink"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Insights"}</p><h2 id={"fp1-insights-title"} className={"mt-5 mb-0 max-w-[24ch] text-[clamp(2.25rem,1.2rem+3.2vw,4rem)] leading-[1.02] text-balance"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"80"}>{"Plain-English notes "}<span className={"font-light"}>{"on money decisions."}</span></h2></div><a href={"#page=demo-financial-planner-1-insights"} className={"btn btn-link btn-link-arrow"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"160"}><span className={"link-arrow"} aria-hidden={"true"}></span>{"All Insights"}</a></div><ul className={"mt-[clamp(2.5rem,2rem+2vw,4rem)] mb-0 grid list-none gap-x-8 gap-y-12 p-0 md:grid-cols-3"} role={"list"} data-anim-stagger={"90"}><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><article className={"relative"}><div className={"overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-xl) aspect-[4/3]"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1800x1200.svg"} alt={"A woman reading through her tax letters at the dining table with a cup of tea"} width={"1800"} height={"1200"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} className={"size-full object-cover"} style={{"objectPosition": "55% 40%"}} /></div><p className={"mt-6 mb-0 flex items-center gap-3 text-base text-soft"}><span className={"font-semibold text-primary-ink"}>{"Tax"}</span><span aria-hidden={"true"}>{"·"}</span><span>{"7 min read"}</span></p><h3 className={"mt-3 mb-0 text-[1.5rem] leading-snug text-balance"}><a href={"#page=demo-financial-planner-1-article"} className={"custom-link-title after:absolute after:inset-0"}>{"Roth conversions in a low-income year: who should consider one"}</a></h3></article></li><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><article className={"relative"}><div className={"overflow-hidden rounded-(--radius-xl) aspect-[4/3]"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/1800x1200.svg"} alt={"A young man reading a letter at his kitchen counter with a coffee"} width={"1800"} height={"1200"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} className={"size-full object-cover"} style={{"objectPosition": "45% 40%"}} /></div><p className={"mt-6 mb-0 flex items-center gap-3 text-base text-soft"}><span className={"font-semibold text-primary-ink"}>{"Equity Comp"}</span><span aria-hidden={"t